"subscription.privacy.body" = "Nomad Kit stores your profile, checklists, and travel history on your device. Location access and photo access are optional and are used only when you choose those features. Selected photo location metadata is processed to suggest visited places; Nomad Kit does not upload or retain your photos. Purchases are processed by Apple, and Nomad Kit receives only the subscription status needed to unlock Pro. Visa, residency, insurance, health, transport, pricing, and entry information is provided for general reference only.";
"subscription.terms.body" = "Nomad Kit Pro is an auto-renewable subscription. Payment is charged to your Apple Account after purchase confirmation. A free trial, when available and when you are eligible, converts to the displayed annual price unless canceled before the trial ends. Subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel your subscription in your Apple Account subscription settings. Free data remains available after Pro expires; Pro-only creation and access stop until you subscribe again. Apple's Standard End User License Agreement also applies.";
